ship = Jool 1
version = 1.12.5
description = Uncrewed Jool orbiter. Probe: OKTO, Z-1k, Advanced Inline Stabilizer, 4 x Mk1 LF fuselage (1600 LF) + LV-N Nerv (~6600 m/s vac, TWR 0.44): the Nerv stage stays with the probe for the Jool capture and a later moon tour. Science: Science Jr, 2 goo, thermometer, barometer, gravioli, magnetometer boom. Comms: 3 x Communotron 88-88 (deployable, combined ~228 G -> ~107 Gm with DSN 2). Power: 3 Gigantors (~3 EC/s at Jool) + 4 Z-400 + Z-1k (~2610 EC). Launcher: Rescue 5 / Minmus Lab 1 pattern - Mainsail + 2 x X200-32, Skipper + X200-32 + X200-16 (~3700 m/s: the Nerv should reach LKO full). Fins on every atmospheric stage (AV-R8 x4 x2, AV-T1 x4 on the Nerv stage), Gigantors low on the probe stack, whole stack rigid + autostrut Root.
type = VAB
size = 3,10,3
steamPublishedFileId = 0
persistentId = 431627377
rot = 0,0,0,1
missionFlag = Squad/Flags/default
vesselType = Ship
